                                       <span>Menampilkan {filteredList.length === 0 ? 0 : (trackingPage - 1) * trackingRowsPerPage + 1}-{Math.min(filteredList.length, trackingPage * trackingRowsPerPage)} dari {filteredList.length} resi (Total {totalCount} resi tercatat hari ini).</span>
                                       
